# The image's own ignore file, which replaces the root .dockerignore for it. Deny
# everything, then admit what the build reads: the wheelhouse, the shared uv entry
# point, the double's project, source and fixtures, and the lane CA's certificates
# and generator from the controls project. No environment, cache or build output
# of either project enters the context, nor a leaf key `make tls` wrote locally:
# the build generates its own.

*

!.dist/

!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/uv_project.py

!tools/
tools/*
!tools/mediation-lane-double/
tools/mediation-lane-double/*
!tools/mediation-lane-double/pyproject.toml
!tools/mediation-lane-double/uv.lock
!tools/mediation-lane-double/README.md
!tools/mediation-lane-double/src/
!tools/mediation-lane-double/fixtures/

!tools/lane-double-controls/
tools/lane-double-controls/*
!tools/lane-double-controls/tls/
tools/lane-double-controls/tls/*.key.pem

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
